{
  "id": "6adb31e1a50460f124813697",
  "title": "Vampire Survivorsオンライン協力プレイやってみたい人～？",
  "created": 1792750050,
  "updated": 1792888213,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6adb31e1a50460f124813697",
      "text": "Vampire Survivorsオンライン協力プレイやってみたい人～？",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792750050,
      "updated": 1792750050
    },
    {
      "id": "6adb31e000000000008fca8a",
      "text": "[Vampire Survivors]のマルチプレイ",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792750050,
      "updated": 1792750371
    },
    {
      "id": "6adb331e0000000000a55b0d",
      "text": "ルームつくってID教えるだけですぐ遊べるっぽい",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792750368,
      "updated": 1792750368
    },
    {
      "id": "6adb33210000000000a55b0e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792750372,
      "updated": 1792750372
    },
    {
      "id": "6adb31ea00000000008fca8d",
      "text": "人集まるようならやってみたいかも[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792750060,
      "updated": 1792750372
    },
    {
      "id": "6adb31f100000000008fca8e",
      "text": "やろう[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792750067,
      "updated": 1792762370
    },
    {
      "id": "6adb31e100000000008fca8b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792750052,
      "updated": 1792750052
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc02d60000000000ea6b0c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792803544,
      "updated": 1792803544
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc02d80000000000ea6b0e",
      "text": "日程調整むずそう[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792803544,
      "updated": 1792803549
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc02dc0000000000ea6b0f",
      "text": "\t日付ページで今なら遊べる言うて部屋立てといて、誰か来たらラッキーくらいか",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792803549,
      "updated": 1792803570
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc02d60000000000ea6b0d",
      "text": "本日いつでもいけるので時間指定してもらえたら👌[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792803544,
      "updated": 1792808900
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc1ef80000000000766e94",
      "text": "13:00～ はどうでしょう[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792810745,
      "updated": 1792810752
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc1ffa0000000000dbb663",
      "text": " おけです！[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792811003,
      "updated": 1792811014
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc17540000000000dbb662",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792808788,
      "updated": 1792808788
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc299d0000000000766e9b",
      "text": "13:00前くらいに張る",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792813470,
      "updated": 1792813486
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc29ad0000000000766e9c",
      "text": "[*** ルームID: 3UGUXN]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792813486,
      "updated": 1792814221
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc299b0000000000766e99",
      "text": "[https://gyazo.com/1c3f0890c8eebe95b20101d8d1319bd6]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792813468,
      "updated": 1792814212
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc2c830000000000766e9d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792814212,
      "updated": 1792814219
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc2ca30000000000766e9e",
      "text": "お、来た",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792814244,
      "updated": 1792814246
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc2ca60000000000766ea0",
      "text": "はじめる",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792814246,
      "updated": 1792814249
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc2cce0000000000766ea1",
      "text": "ステージどうしよ[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792814287,
      "updated": 1792814301
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc2cd50000000000dbb664",
      "text": "👋[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792814293,
      "updated": 1792814300
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc299b0000000000766e9a",
      "text": "適当にやるか[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792813468,
      "updated": 1792814308
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc351f0000000000dbb666",
      "text": "めっちゃお得や[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792816416,
      "updated": 1792816419
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc352b0000000000dbb667",
      "text": "\tワシの武器も進化させたい",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792816428,
      "updated": 1792816436
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc2ce30000000000766ea3",
      "text": "おお、楽しい[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792814308,
      "updated": 1792816422
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc352a0000000000766ea4",
      "text": "\t魔女？使ったことなかったけど、素早くて良さそうだ",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792816427,
      "updated": 1792816444
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc353c0000000000766ea5",
      "text": "ステージやりたいところある？[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792816445,
      "updated": 1792816462
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc2ce20000000000766ea2",
      "text": "テキトーにガロの塔で",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792814307,
      "updated": 1792816510
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc3b360000000000dbb669",
      "text": "こんどは足おっそw[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792817975,
      "updated": 1792817985
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc3b640000000000dbb66a",
      "text": " 羽ないす",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792818020,
      "updated": 1792818023
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc357b0000000000766ea6",
      "text": "なんも見えんw",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792816509,
      "updated": 1792818543
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc3e050000000000766ea7",
      "text": "\tわかる[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792818694,
      "updated": 1792818696
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc3d6a0000000000dbb66b",
      "text": "\tおお、31分達成できた[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792818539,
      "updated": 1792818704
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc3e090000000000766ea8",
      "text": " 地獄の逃避行[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792818698,
      "updated": 1792818712
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc3e410000000000766eaa",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792818755,
      "updated": 1792818755
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc3e140000000000dbb66c",
      "text": "あざす、楽しかった[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792818709,
      "updated": 1792818755
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc3e3f0000000000766ea9",
      "text": "ありがとう！おつ[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792818752,
      "updated": 1792818760
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc3e4e0000000000dbb66e",
      "text": "\tめちゃ稼げた",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792818766,
      "updated": 1792818768
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc3e460000000000dbb66d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792818758,
      "updated": 1792818758
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc3eb50000000000766eab",
      "text": "[https://gyazo.com/508781565769be6dcc8d1697a64e300f]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792818870,
      "updated": 1792818878
    },
    {
      "id": "6add4d8d0000000000c441bb",
      "text": "\tおー！いい絵とれてる[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792888206,
      "updated": 1792888213
    },
